<tr><td bgcolor="#ffffff"><font face="JetBrains Mono">1000–BFFF</font></td><td bgcolor="#ffffff">RAM di espansione (fino a 48 KB)</td><td bgcolor="#ffffff">HIRES 2000–5FFF (GEN2)</td></tr>
